{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18277","headline":"奉使常山早次太原呈副使吴郎中 · 韩愈","name":"奉使常山早次太原呈副使吴郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗朗闻街鼓，晨起似朝时。\n翻翻走驿马，春尽是归期。\n地失嘉禾处，风存蟋蟀辞。\n暮齿良多感，无事涕垂颐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}